        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "23.19 All part time employees hired on or after June 19, 1994 covered by this agreement who have completed four (4) or more months continuous employment with the employer shall receive four (4) hours holiday pay based on their regular straight time hourly wage rate for each of the following holidays:",
