        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "23.23 Part time employees who are promoted to full time positions shall be entitled to receive full time holidays. Part time employees who have completed six (6) months service and who are promoted to full time positions, shall be entitled to receive full time personal, anniversary and birthday holidays.",
