        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "24.02 Any full time employee, except a night crew employee, who works on Sundays, shall be scheduled for four (4) hours work, provided the employee is available. Any full time night crew employee who works on Sundays or Holidays, shall be scheduled for eight (8) hours work, provided the employee is available.",
